  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 504.01 Availability of Financial Assistance from the CWSRF",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 504.01 Availability of Financial Assistance from the CWSRF. The CWSRF shall be used to provide financial assistance as authorized by a specific capitalization grant to eligible entities for the planning, design, construction, and refinancing of pollution abatement projects, whether covered under §211, §212, §319, or §320 of the CWA or a specific capitalization grant, including but not limited to the projects listed in Env-Wq 504.02 and Env-Wq 504.04.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq500.html"
